{"id": "1b982ff0-5c09-423e-aca1-2ec5d06f4792", "slug": "premium-saas-dashboard-experience", "title": "Premium SaaS Dashboard Experience", "description": "Premium Saas Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Premium SaaS Dashboard Experience\"\ndescription: \"Premium Saas Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  accent: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#3A3A3C\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#3A3A3C\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"55px\"\n  control: \"45px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Premium SaaS Dashboard Experience\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 20; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, animated, threejs, charts, billing, navigation, support, flow.\n## Overview\nPremium Saas Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nNext Gen Analytics Medium 500, Regular -> Light 300) --> 9:41 Good morning, Julie Carter Total Revenue $128,540 12.5% vs last month Overview This Month Subscriptions 2,845 8.2% Active Users 18,573 14.3% Churn Rate 2.45%…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Next Gen Analytics; $128,540; Overview; Recent Transactions.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #8B5CF6, accent #8B5CF6, background #FFFFFF, surface #3A3A3C, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Premium SaaS Dashboard Experience</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify Solar Icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP for Animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #050505;\n            overflow: hidden; /* Lock scroll for full-scene experience */\n        }\n\n        /* Hide Scrollbar for internal screen */\n        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        .hide-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n\n        /* Perspective & Hardware Mockup Styles */\n        .scene-perspective {\n            perspective: 1200px;\n        }\n\n        .mockup-chassis {\n            box-shadow:\n                -20px 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),\n                inset -2px 0px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),\n                inset 2px 0px 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),\n                0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n\n        /* Ambient Light Sweep on Device Edge */\n        .mockup-chassis::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 45%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 55%, transparent 70%);\n            background-size: 300% 100%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 50;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n            animation: edgeSweep 8s infinite linear;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes edgeSweep {\n            0% { background-position: 150% 0; }\n            100% { background-position: -50% 0; }\n        }\n\n        /* Skill Directive: Border Gradients */\n        .gradient-border-surface {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #1e1e22; /* Slightly distinct from screen bg */\n            background-clip: padding-box;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-surface::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            margin: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\n            z-index: -1;\n        }\n\n        /* Skill Directive: Masked Reveal container setup */\n        .clip-mask {\n            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-white antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background Scene (Aura Asset) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0\">\n        <!-- Using a moody architectural shot to simulate the requested warm, rocky, dramatic lighting -->\n        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/247842dc-61df-4a5e-8ccd-e41cfec454b0_3840w.webp\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 blur-[40px] scale-110 scene-bg\" alt=\"Ambient Background\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a0a0c] via-[#0a0a0c]/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(139,92,246,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Skill Directive: Masked Reveal Title -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-[15%] w-full text-center z-10 pointer-events-none select-none px-6\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-7xl tracking-tight font-medium text-white/10 uppercase tracking-widest reveal-title\">\n            <div class=\"clip-mask overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"block transform translate-y-full title-word\">Next</span></div>\n            <div class=\"clip-mask overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"block transform translate-y-full title-word\">Gen</span></div>\n            <br>\n            <div class=\"clip-mask overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"block transform translate-y-full title-word\">Analytics</span></div>\n        </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3D Scene Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-20 w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center scene-perspective\">\n\n        <!-- iPhone Hardware Mockup -->\n        <!-- Note: Font weights are shifted down per instructions (Bold -> Medium 500, Regular -> Light 300) -->\n        <div class=\"device-wrapper relative w-[340px] h-[720px] rounded-[55px] bg-[#1a1a1c] p-[10px] mockup-chassis transform-gpu\" id=\"device\">\n\n            <!-- Hardware Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[2px] top-[110px] w-[3px] h-[25px] bg-[#3a3a3c] rounded-l-md shadow-inner\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[2px] top-[150px] w-[3px] h-[50px] bg-[#3a3a3c] rounded-l-md shadow-inner\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-[2px] top-[210px] w-[3px] h-[50px] bg-[#3a3a3c] rounded-l-md shadow-inner\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-[2px] top-[180px] w-[3px] h-[70px] bg-[#3a3a3c] rounded-r-md shadow-inner\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Screen Area -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#121214] rounded-[45px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col pt-12 pb-20 px-5 ring-1 ring-black shadow-inner\">\n\n                <!-- Dynamic Island / Notch -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[10px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[110px] h-[30px] bg-black rounded-full z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-3\">\n                    <!-- Fake camera lens reflection -->\n                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#111] border border-white/5 relative overflow-hidden hidden md:block\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-[2px] right-[2px] w-1 h-1 bg-blue-500/30 rounded-full blur-[1px]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Status Bar -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-6 right-6 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px] font-medium text-white z-40\">\n                    <span class=\"tracking-wide\">9:41</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 opacity-90\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cellular-linear\" class=\"text-[13px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wifi-linear\" class=\"text-[13px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:battery-charge-linear\" class=\"text-[14px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Scrollable Dashboard Content -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto hide-scrollbar flex flex-col gap-6 relative z-10 pt-4 pb-10\">\n\n                    <!-- Header -->\n                    <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between ui-element opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                            <!-- Aura Asset: Portrait -->\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-[42px] h-[42px] rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10 shadow-sm\" alt=\"User\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-[12px] text-white/50 font-light mb-0.5\">Good morning,</p>\n                                <p class=\"text-[15px] text-white font-medium tracking-tight\">Julie Carter</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/[0.03] flex items-center justify-center border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" class=\"text-[18px] text-white/80\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </header>\n\n                    <!-- Main Revenue Card (Skill Directive: Gradient Border) -->\n                    <div class=\"rounded-3xl p-5 gradient-border-surface shadow-2xl shadow-black/50 ui-element opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-5\">\n                            <div>\n                                <p class=\"text-[13px] text-white/50 font-light mb-1\">Total Revenue</p>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-end gap-3\">\n                                    <h2 class=\"text-[28px] tracking-tight font-medium text-white leading-none rev-number\">$128,540</h2>\n                                    <span class=\"px-2 py-[2px] rounded-md bg-[#10b981]/15 text-[#34d399] text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center gap-0.5 mb-1 border border-[#10b981]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"2\"></iconify-icon> 12.5%\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] text-white/30 font-light mt-1.5\">vs last month</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#8b5cf6] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(139,92,246,0.4)]\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-[20px] text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Animated SVG Line Chart -->\n                        <div class=\"h-[60px] w-full relative -mx-1\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 60\" class=\"w-full h-full preserve-aspect-none overflow-visible\">\n                                <defs>\n                                    <linearGradient id=\"chartGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\n                                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\" stop-opacity=\"0.3\"></stop>\n                                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#8b5cf6\" stop-opacity=\"0\"></stop>\n                                    </linearGradient>\n                                    <filter id=\"glow\">\n                                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"2\" result=\"coloredBlur\"></feGaussianBlur>\n                                        <feMerge>\n                                            <feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"></feMergeNode>\n                                            <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"></feMergeNode>\n                                        </feMerge>\n                                    </filter>\n                                </defs>\n                                <!-- Fill Area -->\n                                <path d=\"M0,60 L0,45 C20,45 35,55 60,40 C80,28 90,15 110,20 C130,25 140,40 160,35 C180,30 190,10 200,15 L200,60 Z\" fill=\"url(#chartGrad)\" class=\"chart-fill opacity-0\"></path>\n                                <!-- Smooth Stroke -->\n                                <path d=\"M0,45 C20,45 35,55 60,40 C80,28 90,15 110,20 C130,25 140,40 160,35 C180,30 190,10 200,15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" class=\"chart-line\"></path>\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Overview List -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 ui-element opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-white/90\">Overview</h3>\n                            <button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-white/60 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">\n                                This Month <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[20px] bg-[#1a1a1e] border border-white/[0.03]\">\n                            <!-- Item 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#3b82f6] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(59,130,246,0.3)]\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-white text-[18px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-white/80\">Subscriptions</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white\">2,845</span>\n                                    <span class=\"w-[50px] px-1 py-[2px] rounded-md bg-[#10b981]/15 text-[#34d399] text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-0.5 border border-[#10b981]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-up-linear\"></iconify-icon> 8.2%\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#10b981] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-white text-[18px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-white/80\">Active Users</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white\">18,573</span>\n                                    <span class=\"w-[50px] px-1 py-[2px] rounded-md bg-[#10b981]/15 text-[#34d399] text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-0.5 border border-[#10b981]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-up-linear\"></iconify-icon> 14.3%\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Item 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#f97316] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(249,115,22,0.3)]\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pulse-linear\" class=\"text-white text-[18px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-light text-white/80\">Churn Rate</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white\">2.45%</span>\n                                    <span class=\"w-[50px] px-1 py-[2px] rounded-md bg-[#ef4444]/15 text-[#f87171] text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-0.5 border border-[#ef4444]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\"></iconify-icon> 2.1%\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Recent Transactions -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 ui-element opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-white/90\">Recent Transactions</h3>\n                            <button class=\"text-[11px] font-light text-[#8b5cf6] hover:text-[#a78bfa] transition-colors\">View all</button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col rounded-[20px] bg-[#1a1a1e] border border-white/[0.03]\">\n                            <!-- Tx 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5 border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-[14px] bg-[#3b82f6]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#60a5fa] border border-[#3b82f6]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white/90 mb-0.5\">Acme Corporation</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-light text-white/40\">Pro Plan · Annual</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-right\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white mb-0.5\">+$2,400</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-light text-white/40\">2h ago</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Tx 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-3.5\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-[14px] bg-[#10b981]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#34d399] border border-[#10b981]/20\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white/90 mb-0.5\">Globex LLC</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-light text-white/40\">Pro Plan · Monthly</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-right\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-white mb-0.5\">+$99</p>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-light text-white/40\">5h ago</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar -->\n                <nav class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-[#121214]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-t border-white/[0.05] pb-6 pt-3 px-6 z-30\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n                        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-[#8b5cf6]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-[#8b5cf6]/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-medium\">Dashboard</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-light\">Customers</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-light\">Billing</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-light\">Reports</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-white/40 hover:text-white/80 transition-colors\">\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-square-linear\" class=\"text-[20px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[9px] font-light\">More</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- iOS Home Indicator -->\n                    <div class=\"w-[120px] h-[4px] bg-white/40 rounded-full mx-auto mt-4\"></div>\n                </nav>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Animation Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Scene Background subtle movement\n            gsap.to('.scene-bg', {\n                scale: 1.15,\n                duration: 20,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // 2. Skill Directive: Masked Word Reveal\n            gsap.to('.title-word', {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // 3. Cinematic push-in and orienting of the Device\n            const tlDevice = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.5 });\n\n            // Initial state set via JS for clean load\n            gsap.set('#device', {\n                scale: 0.85,\n                rotateX: 15,\n                rotateY: -20,\n                y: 100,\n                opacity: 0\n            });\n\n            tlDevice.to('#device', {\n                scale: 1,\n                rotateX: 8,      // Slight perspective angle to match \"mockup\" feel\n                rotateY: -12,\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            })\n            // 4. Subtle floating/parallax motion\n            .to('#device', {\n                y: \"-=15\",\n                rotateX: 6,\n                rotateY: -10,\n                duration: 4,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=0.5\");\n\n            // 5. Stagger in UI Elements inside the screen\n            gsap.to('.ui-element', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.12,\n                ease: \"power2.out\",\n                delay: 1.5\n            });\n\n            // 6. Animate SVG Line Chart Drawing\n            const path = document.querySelector('.chart-line');\n            if (path) {\n                const length = path.getTotalLength();\n                gsap.set(path, { strokeDasharray: length, strokeDashoffset: length });\n\n                gsap.to(path, {\n                    strokeDashoffset: 0,\n                    duration: 1.8,\n                    ease: \"power2.inOut\",\n                    delay: 2.2\n                });\n\n                // Fade in the gradient fill under the line\n                gsap.to('.chart-fill', {\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    delay: 2.8\n                });\n            }\n\n            // 7. Subtle glow pulse on main metric\n            gsap.to('.rev-number', {\n                textShadow: \"0px 0px 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\",\n                duration: 2,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                delay: 3\n            });\n\n            // Interaction: Mouse Parallax Effect on Document\n            document.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 20;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 20;\n\n                // Very subtle rotation based on mouse to enhance 3D feel\n                gsap.to('#device', {\n                    rotateY: -12 + (x * 0.5),\n                    rotateX: 8 - (y * 0.5),\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: \"power1.out\",\n                    overwrite: \"auto\" // Prevent conflicts with floating animation loop\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "premium-saas-dashboard-experience.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/premium-saas-dashboard-experience.jpg", "source_name": "premium-saas-dashboard-experience-DESIGN.md", "views": 57, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T00:11:48.542559+00:00"}